SUMMARY:Inclusive Sounds Music Fundraiser
DESCRIPTION:Inclusive Sounds is a live music fundraising event taking place on Saturday\, May 9th\, from 5 PM–11 PM at The Duke (1225 Queen Street East\, Toronto). The event celebrates diversity\, accessibility\, and community\, bringing together talented bands from across the GTA for an evening of live performances\, alongside a live auction and raffles. \nThis initiative supports organizations such as Pegasus Toronto and Judy’s Café\, which are dedicated to creating meaningful opportunities for neurodivergent individuals.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/inclusive-sounds-music-fundraiser/
LOCATION:The Duke Live\, 1225 Queen St. E\, Toronto\, M4M 1L6
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/27191446/IMG-20260409-WA0000.jpg
END:VEVENT
